flowchart TD
    T[Task + CompletionContract] --> W[Agent/Team Work]
    W --> CC[CANDIDATE_COMPLETE]
    CC --> CE[Completion Engine]
    CE -->|Fail| W
    CE -->|Verified| O[Verified Outcome]
    O --> EV[Independent Evaluator]
    EV --> OH[Organization Health]
    OH --> OP[Optimization]
    OP --> EX[Shadow / A-B / Canary Experiment]
    EX --> EV
    EV --> REC[Recommendation]
    REC --> GOV[Governance]
    GOV -->|Keep/Promote| CH[Versioned Organization Change]
    GOV -->|Reject/Revert| RV[Rollback]
